<title>MALAWI: PRESS DIGEST - Malawi - Sept 30.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malawi - Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>BLANTYRE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Malawi press on Monday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>THE NATION</p>
<p>Malawi's Electoral Commission has used more than $1-million of public funds in car hire deals with ghost firms since 1994, an audit probe at the Road Traffic Commission revealed.</p>
<p>THE WEEKLY CHRONICLE</p>
<p>- Five members of a family were last Friday wiped out by food poisoning in Lilongwe.</p>
